@Julius2342, as you can see in the traceback by @jcoetsie, the exception already gets raised in async_setup. Due to this exception, the velux component doesn't get registered.

I think async_setup should be changed in a way that it never fails due to connection problems, e.g. by delaying the call to async_start and retrying until successful.

Examples for components working with offline devices are ps4 and ipp.
